X1 port1 port2 Model1A PARAMS:
+ R1=65
+ R2=0.0137
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.000701
+ K2=2.15
+ K3= {Ind}
+ K4=0.243
+ K5=0.0000055
.ends SER1390-103_freq

